Since Vodafone Ghana rebranded to **Telecel Ghana**, mobile internet users across Accra, Kumasi, Takoradi, and other major cities have been looking for clear pricing and reliable data top-up options.

Telecel is widely known for offering generous bulk data allocations, especially for remote workers, university students, content creators, and small business owners who rely on stable, heavy internet connections.

In this guide, we cover the full pricing breakdown for Telecel bundles, the essential shortcodes to remember, and how to get your SIM credited in minutes.

## Why choose Telecel non-expiry data?

The biggest advantage of Telecel non-expiry data is flexibility. If you are a heavy data user or if you use a MiFi router for your home or office, you do not have to worry about your remaining gigabytes expiring at the end of the week.

Your balance stays active until you finish every single megabyte.

## Telecel Data Pricing Overview

Here are the popular data packages available for Telecel users on GB Plug:

- **10 GB:** GH₵ 41.50 (Non-Expiry)
- **15 GB:** GH₵ 62.00 (Non-Expiry)
- **20 GB:** GH₵ 82.00 (Non-Expiry)
- **30 GB:** GH₵ 121.50 (Non-Expiry)
- **40 GB:** GH₵ 161.50 (Non-Expiry)
- **50 GB:** GH₵ 200.50 (Non-Expiry)

## Essential Telecel Shortcodes

Keep these official USSD shortcodes handy on your phone:

- **Check Main Account Balance:** \*124#
- **Check Data and Bonus Balances:** \*126#
- **Telecel Cash Menu:** \*110#
- **Customer Care Hotline:** 100 or 0505555111

## How to top up Telecel data on GB Plug

If you want to skip long USSD menus and top up with Mobile Money:

1. Go to [gbplug.com](https://gbplug.com).
2. Select **Telecel** from the network options.
3. Choose your bundle package (from 10 GB up to 50 GB).
4. Enter your 10-digit Telecel phone number (starting with 020 or 050).
5. Complete payment using MTN MoMo, Telecel Cash, or AT Money.
6. The bundle is automatically sent to your SIM card within minutes.

Track your live delivery status anytime on our [Track Order page](https://gbplug.com/track-order).
